  "description": [
    "Ankle-deep water pervades this portion of the neighborhood, rendering it unsuitable for residences but well-suited for the moisture-tolerant perennials.  Far-off shrieks and growls grow in both proximity and intensity and, like an intruder's warning, evolves to a disorienting cacophony.  Debris resembling fish skeletons joins in the alarm and churns within the shallow, murky water, but subsides when the community outburst concludes."
